# <AREA> — Backlog

> One backlog file per feature area (`docs/<AREA>_BACKLOG.md`). Deferred work must be WRITTEN, not
> spoken: a turn whose summary names any "later", follow-up PR, known gap or deferred phase may not
> end until the item is here (Chapter 12). A backlog card is a claim, not evidence — verify state in
> `PROJECT.md` §3 before trusting a "done".
>
> **Id discipline.** Items are `<AREA>-N`. Before taking the next N, check the remote AND other
> sessions' open PRs — concurrent sessions have taken the same id on the same day.

## 🔴 Next — do these first

### <AREA>-1 — <Short title>
- **Why.** <one sentence on user value or technical reason>
- **Effort.** <hours / days / weeks>
- **Where.** <file paths or component names if known>
- **Revisit when.** <the condition or signal to look for>

