## ✓ Done — kept for context

### ✓ DONE — PR #<N> (<YYYY-MM-DD>) — <AREA>-0 — <Short title>
- **Why.** … (body left in place so the next agent sees the reasoning)
- **Where.** …

---

## How to pick this up in a future session

Say any of: *"What's pending on <area>?"* (summary of this file) · *"Let's do <item title>"* (scope
and start that entry) · *"Resume <area>"* (this file + recent PRs + your last instruction).

## Convention for adding items

Append to the right section. Every entry has all four fields. When done, prepend
`✓ DONE — PR #N (date)` to the title and move it to the Done section — never delete the body.
